OL,3,GNEWSAMan killed in tiger attack
OL,4,Aidentified as William Chapman
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe man who was killed by a tiger after
OL,7,Fentering its enclosure at a wildlife
OL,8,Fpark has been identified as William
OL,9,FChapman, the BBC understands.
OL,11,FChapman, who visited Yorkshire Wildlife
OL,12,FPark near Doncaster on his own, entered
OL,13,Fthe enclosure shortly after 13:30 BST
OL,14,Fon Saturday and was pronounced dead at
OL,15,Fthe scene, according to South Yorkshire
OL,16,FPolice.
OL,23,APub: 13-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,372,370,200,160,0,100
