OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-, *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSAMan killed in tiger attack
OL,4,Aidentified as William Chapman
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn eyewitness described seeing him
OL,7,Fwearing headphones and "pacing around"
OL,8,Fnear the enclosure before he went in.
OL,9,FMobile phone footage, believed to be
OL,10,Ffrom Chapman, appears to show the
OL,11,Finside of the enclosure as he
OL,12,Fapproaches the tiger across a patch of
OL,13,Fgrass.
OL,15,FA force spokesperson said his family
OL,16,Fwas aware and was being supported by
OL,17,Fspecialist officers.
